## Summary of how registration dates are handled

The `POST /api/owners` flow is an OfficeFloor step pipeline. The registration date is defaulted to `LocalDate.now()` in `BuildOwner`. There is **no business-day / weekend / holiday roll-forward logic anywhere in `src/main`** — only the acceptance test asserts the invariant (that the default date is never a weekend), and the test file `AcceptanceBase.java` contains a reference `toBusinessDay(...)` helper plus a pinned `HOLIDAYS` set. The membership-number year segment is derived in `Owner.getMembershipNumber()`. The daily create-limit lives in `EnsureDailyLimit`.

